22:["$","section",null,{"className":"Intro_intro__B7xXJ","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"children":"Find your verbal edge."}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_text__4DPtt prose","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Where AI has filled every channel with polished, forgettable copy, we build voices that people can recognise, teams can use and competitors can’t easily imitate. From the big brand statement to the tiny button label, every word pulling in the same direction.</span></p>\n"}}]}]}]]}]}]
23:["$","section",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_textImageRows__lOU02","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[[["$","div","0",{"className":"TextImageRows_row__PPlpB","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Tone of voice strategy."}}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Before we choose the words, we decide what the voice needs to do. We connect your tone to your positioning, USPs, audience and ambitions, then define the character behind it. Sharp or understated. Warm or straight-talking. Playful where it counts. Serious when it matters.</p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_media__twu3R","children":["$","$L2f",null,{"fill":true,"children":[false,["$","$L20",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/tone-of-voice-V3.mp4","layout":"fill"}]]}]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"TextImageRows_row__PPlpB","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Brand language development."}}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>This is where your voice starts to sound like a real person rather than a brand workshop. We develop the vocabulary, phrasing, sentence styles and verbal quirks that make your writing recognisable. We also identify the tired category language you can happily leave to everyone else.</p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_media__twu3R","children":["$","$L2f",null,{"fill":true,"children":[["$","$L21",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/brand-language.jpg 1224w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/brand-language-500x500.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/brand-language-768x768.jpg 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/brand-language.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1224,"height":1224}},"layout":"fill"}],false]}]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"TextImageRows_row__PPlpB","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Messaging principles."}}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Strong writing needs something solid underneath it. We create clear principles for how you explain what you do, what you believe and why anyone should care. Enough structure to keep the message consistent, without forcing everyone to repeat the same approved paragraph forever.</p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_media__twu3R","children":["$","$L2f",null,{"fill":true,"children":[false,["$","$L20",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/messaging-principles-V2.mp4","layout":"fill"}]]}]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"TextImageRows_row__PPlpB","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Audience and brand voice workshops."}}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Everyone has an opinion on copy. Workshops stop those opinions becoming the strategy. We get the right people talking about your audience, your culture and the kind of brand you want to become. Then we turn that conversation into decisions your team can actually use.</p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_media__twu3R","children":["$","$L2f",null,{"fill":true,"children":[["$","$L21",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/audience-brand-voice.jpg 1224w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/audience-brand-voice-500x500.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/audience-brand-voice-768x768.jpg 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/audience-brand-voice.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1224,"height":1224}},"layout":"fill"}],false]}]}]]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"TextImageRows_row__PPlpB","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Real-world applications."}}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A few adjectives on a slide won’t change how your brand sounds. We show the voice working across real touchpoints, including website copy, campaigns, social posts, decks, emails and calls to action. Your team sees exactly how the principles translate into everyday writing.</p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_media__twu3R","children":["$","$L2f",null,{"fill":true,"children":[["$","$L21",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/real-world.jpg 1224w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/real-world-500x500.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/real-world-768x768.jpg 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/real-world.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1224,"height":1224}},"layout":"fill"}],false]}]}]]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"TextImageRows_row__PPlpB","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Do’s and don’ts documentation."}}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Know what sounds right. Spot what doesn’t. We create straightforward guidance with side-by-side examples, preferred language and phrases to avoid. No cryptic brand theory. No ‘bold yet approachable’. Just practical direction that helps people write better.</p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_media__twu3R","children":["$","$L2f",null,{"fill":true,"children":[["$","$L21",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/dos-donts.jpg 1224w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/dos-donts-500x500.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/dos-donts-768x768.jpg 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/dos-donts.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1224,"height":1224}},"layout":"fill"}],false]}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_row__PPlpB","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__bRCSP","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_heading__RS3OS","children":["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Audit your brand in minutes"}}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"TextImageRows_text__